Gladys Google Cloud Text-to-Speech integration
Copyright 2026 William-De71

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It sends the texts a Gladys Assistant instance speaks (scene notifications,
replies of the voice assistant) to the Cloud Text-to-Speech API
(https://texttospeech.googleapis.com), with the API key of the
administrator, and returns the audio to Gladys.

